{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An account is reached by its slug rather than by the address the account signs in as."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The model-account page type is reached by its id rather than by a spelled slug."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An account is made stating the address the account signs in as and the alias the account answers to."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The rest of the values an account states is answered by the upstream probe at its first sign-in."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The marks observed of an account sit beside its page rather than in that page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A declaration saying where a value sits routes every mark written here."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A mark whose key this page type does not declare is refused rather than written."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every account akasha holds with a provider is a model-account."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An account states the provider serving it, and its credential sits beside it."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A reader wanting one provider's accounts asks for that provider by name."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Every Anthropic account holds the whole fleet's work in turn."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"No account is any persona's own."}]}
{"definition":"one account a provider serves calls on"}
